{"name_en": "Theodore of Heraclea", "zh": "狄奧多", "sei": "狄奧", "mei": "多", "zh_full": "赫拉克利亞的狄奧多", "sex": "m", "years": [335, 355], "birth": null, "death": 355, "death_violent": false, "polity": "阿里烏派", "role": "宗教", "place": "赫拉克利亞", "lat": 40.97, "lon": 27.95, "offices": ["赫拉克利亞主教"], "kin": [], "friends": ["Eusebius of Nicomedia", "Theognis of Nicaea", "Constantius II"], "foes": ["Athanasius of Alexandria"], "bio": "赫拉克利亞主教，以博學著稱，曾注釋福音書。與優西比烏、泰奧格尼斯結黨，屢在君士坦提烏斯二世前攻訐阿塔那修。撒迪卡會議時遁走，被會議罷黜並絕罰，列為阿里烏派首領之一。", "stats": [20, 15, 72, 55, 52], "lean": "無", "conf": "B", "src": "Theodoret 2.2"}
{"name_en": "Asclepas of Gaza", "zh": "阿斯克帕", "sei": "阿斯", "mei": "克帕", "zh_full": "加沙的阿斯克勒帕斯", "sex": "m", "years": [325, 347], "birth": null, "death": null, "death_violent": false, "polity": "羅馬教會", "role": "宗教", "place": "加沙", "lat": 31.5, "lon": 34.47, "offices": ["加沙主教"], "kin": [], "friends": ["Athanasius of Alexandria", "Marcellus of Ancyra"], "foes": ["Eusebius of Nicomedia", "Quintianus of Gaza"], "bio": "加沙主教，持正統信仰，遭阿里烏派誣陷被逐，昆提安努斯被立於其座。赴撒迪卡會議，出示安條克審訊紀錄自證清白，會議宣告其無罪，復其主教之位。", "stats": [18, 12, 55, 50, 55], "lean": "無", "conf": "B", "src": "Theodoret 2.6"}
{"name_en": "Menophantus of Ephesus", "zh": "梅諾凡", "sei": "梅諾", "mei": "凡", "zh_full": "以弗所的梅諾凡圖斯", "sex": "m", "years": [325, 343], "birth": null, "death": null, "death_violent": false, "polity": "阿里烏派", "role": "宗教", "place": "以弗所", "lat": 37.94, "lon": 27.34, "offices": ["以弗所主教"], "kin": [], "friends": ["Eusebius of Nicomedia", "Theodore of Heraclea"], "foes": ["Athanasius of Alexandria"], "bio": "以弗所主教，與優西比烏一黨聯名致書羅馬主教儒略，誣告阿塔那修等人。撒迪卡會議時不肯應訊而逃，被會議罷黜並絕罰。", "stats": [15, 12, 48, 45, 40], "lean": "無", "conf": "B", "src": "Theodoret 2.6"}
{"name_en": "Theodulus of Trajanopolis", "zh": "狄奧杜", "sei": "狄奧", "mei": "杜", "zh_full": "圖拉真諾波利斯的狄奧杜盧斯", "sex": "m", "years": [340, 343], "birth": null, "death": 343, "death_violent": false, "polity": "羅馬教會", "role": "宗教", "place": "圖拉真諾波利斯", "lat": 40.95, "lon": 25.9, "offices": ["主教"], "kin": [], "friends": ["Athanasius of Alexandria"], "foes": ["Eusebius of Nicomedia"], "bio": "正統派主教，遭阿里烏派誣陷，奉命處死，幸而逃脫。撒迪卡會議致各地書中稱其為已故同工，以為阿里烏派迫害之證。", "stats": [12, 10, 40, 38, 45], "lean": "無", "conf": "C", "src": "Theodoret 2.6"}
